WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:08.600
Step 1: Start a Robot Lab project. Start building → Key Stage 2 → Robot Lab.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:13.400
Step 2: Name it and choose its colours. The name goes on its plinth; Body and Trim change its colours.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:16.400
Step 3: Snap blocks together. Moves, faces, lights, speech, sensing, loops and variables.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:21.400
Step 4: Press Run. It talks with the browser’s own voice. Nothing is recorded or sent.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:26.400
Step 5: Tap the robot. “When the robot is tapped” scripts react to a tap.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:34.000
Step 6: Ask a question. “ask and wait” shows a box; the answer block holds what was typed.
